a BC1 block decodes to its endpoint colour when sampled
a Greater depth test keeps the nearer fragment in reversed-Z
a copy captures an intermediate mip level of a GPU-written chain
a copy captures one array layer and mip of a cubemap
a copy writes buffer bytes into a texture sub-rectangle
a cubemap samples the face its direction points at
a depth-only pass stores depth a later pass can sample
a storage texture view addresses a single mip level
a storage texture written by a dispatch is sampled by a later draw
a storage texture written by one dispatch is read by the next
an indirect dispatch reads its threadgroup counts from a buffer
an indirect draw reads its vertex range from a buffer
an indirect indexed draw reads its index range and base vertex from a buffer
an sRGB texture is linearised by the sampler, a linear one is not
the frame-data arena survives twelve frames overlapping in flight
uniform ring survives twelve frames overlapping in flight
